# Page Rules

## Page Structure
- Every page: page.tsx (metadata + server export) + PageClient.tsx (use client + all UI)
- PageClient.tsx always starts with "use client"
- page.tsx exports metadata and re-exports PageClient as default

## Bilingual Content
- Use inline lang ternaries: lang === 'ar' ? 'Arabic text' : 'English text'
- Arabic text always needs style={{ direction: "rtl" }}
- Arabic display text uses font-display class
- Arabic body text: leading-relaxed minimum — never tighter
- Arabic numerals: ١ ٢ ٣ ٤ use font-display for consistent rendering
- Font size for Arabic display: always use clamp() for responsive sizing

## Section Standards
- Every section needs a clear visual hierarchy
- Gold eyebrow labels before every heading: tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-xs text-brand-gold
- Heading: font-display font-[200] text-brand-teal
- Gradient bridge between every section color change
- py-32 minimum padding on all sections

## Brand Tone
- Warm, grounded, quietly confident — never corporate
- Never overly flowery or dramatic copy
- All client copy uses she/her — never he/him or they
- Spiritually aware tone — never secular-corporate